# ${SRC_DIR}/config/

Environment / boot-time configuration for ${PROJECT_NAME}.

## What lives here

- [`env.ts`](env.ts) — zod-validated env loader. Fails fast on boot if a required var is missing.
- [`logger.ts`](logger.ts) — winston logger instance; request-id child logger factory.
- [`mongo.ts`](mongo.ts) — Mongoose connector stub.
- [`postgres.ts`](postgres.ts) — `pg.Pool` factory stub.
<!-- {{IF WITH_I18N}} -->
- [`i18n/`](i18n/) — translation registry and helpers.
<!-- {{ENDIF}} -->

## What does NOT live here

- HTTP handlers or business logic. Those live under `${SRC_DIR}/api/`.
- Domain types. Those live in the feature folder's `types/` or in `${SRC_DIR}/types/`.

## Naming

- Lowercase, one concern per file (`env.ts`, `logger.ts`, `mongo.ts`).
- Suffixes are unnecessary here — each file is named after the resource it configures.

